  "title": "Pedestrian access leg continuous 1 m clear path",
  "text": "Where a pedestrian access leg is required to provide access from a dwelling site to a public street, it is to: ii. provide a continuous path of travel with a minimum width of 1m, clear of any utilities or minor projections (excludes eaves).",
